%%{init: {"sequence": {"htmlLabels": true, "mirrorActors": true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant CLI as CDK CLI<br/>(cdk)
    participant App as CDK App<br/>(bin/app.ts)
    participant Synth as Synthesizer
    participant CFN as CloudFormation
    participant AWS as AWS Account

    Dev->>CLI: cdk synth MyStack
    CLI->>App: instantiate App
    App->>Synth: traverse construct tree
    Synth-->>App: synthesize(stack) per Stack
    App-->>CLI: CloudFormation templates<br/>(JSON/YAML in cdk.out/)
    CLI-->>Dev: cdk.out/MyStack.template.json

    Dev->>CLI: cdk deploy MyStack
    CLI->>CFN: validate + diff templates
    CLI->>CFN: CreateChangeSet + ExecuteChangeSet
    CFN->>AWS: Create/Update resources
    AWS-->>CFN: stack CREATE_COMPLETE
    CFN-->>CLI: outputs + status
    CLI-->>Dev: ✅ MyStack deployed
